#: templates/account.html:37
msgid "Current password"
msgstr "Nykyinen salasana"

#: templates/account.html:40
msgid "New password"
msgstr "Uusi salasana"

#: templates/account.html:42
msgid ""
"Leave blank to keep your current password. Changing it signs you out of all "
"sessions."
msgstr "Jätä tyhjäksi pitääksesi nykyinen salasana. Vaihtamalla kirjaudut ulos kaikista istunnoista."

#: templates/account.html:46
